      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-which-tools-can-you-connect"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Which tools can you connect?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>API check</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq1"><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><b>Website forms</b><em>API ✓</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-cart"/></svg></i><b>Online shop</b><em>API ✓</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><b>Payment gateway</b><em>API ✓</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><b>Accounting</b><em>API ✓</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-sheet"/></svg></i><b>Google Sheets</b><em>API ✓</em></span><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-code"/></svg></i><b>Undocumented API</b><em>Assess first</em></span></div></div></div><p>Tools with a documented API or webhooks: website forms and online shops, payment gateways, accounting software, CRMs, Google Sheets and messaging tools. We check each tool’s API access before quoting. Complex authentication and undocumented APIs need a separate assessment.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv open" id="faq-how-much-does-an-api-integration-cost"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>How much does an API integration cost?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Prices</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq2"><div><b>Connect</b><small>1 source + 1 destination · 1 trigger</small><em>RM1,500</em></div><div class="on"><b>Workflow</b><small>2 systems · 5 mapped actions · validation</small><em>RM4,500</em></div><div><b>Multi-system</b><small>3 systems · 3 workflows · reporting</small><em>RM9,500</em></div></div></div></div><p>It is a one-time build. Connect is from RM1,500 for 1 source and 1 destination, a one-way flow, 1 trigger and up to 2 actions. Workflow is from RM4,500 for up to 2 systems, 1 workflow, up to 5 mapped actions and validation rules. Multi-system is from RM9,500 for up to 3 systems, up to 3 scoped workflows, reporting and exception handling. Your quotation confirms the final scope.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-are-api-and-usage-fees-included"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Are API and usage fees included?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Quotation</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq3"><p><span><b>Build by Neeko</b><small>Workflow package</small></span><em>RM4,500</em></p><p><span><b>Accounting API plan</b><small>Paid to the provider</small></span><em class="g">Listed</em></p><p><span><b>Payment gateway fees</b><small>Paid to the provider</small></span><em class="g">Listed</em></p><span class="igq3f">Confirmed before we build · Sample</span></div></div></div><p>No. API access, permissions and usage fees are set by each tool’s provider and paid by you. We check them during scoping and list them in your quotation before anything is built.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-happens-if-a-sync-fails"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What happens if a sync fails?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Run log</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq4"><p class="h"><i>!</i><span><b>Order #1048 held</b><small>SKU LH-220 not found in accounting</small></span></p><div class="igq4b"><span>Fix SKU</span><span class="b"><span class="igsw"><span class="a">Retry</span><span class="b">Synced ✓</span></span></span></div></div></div></div><p>Every package includes error logging, so each failed run is recorded with the reason. Workflow and Multi-system add validation rules and exception handling: bad records are fixed or held for review instead of reaching your accounts, and your team is alerted.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-is-our-data-safe"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Is our data safe?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Permissions</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq5"><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Read customers</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Create invoices</p><p class="x"><em>–</em>Bank details: not requested</p><span class="igq5f">Keys stay in your account</span></div></div></div><p>Data moves directly between your tools through their own APIs over encrypted connections. We only ask for the permissions the flow needs, keys and tokens stay in your accounts, and you can remove our access after handover. High-volume or regulated workflows are assessed separately.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-do-we-get-at-handover"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What do we get at handover?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Handover pack</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-doc"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq6"><p><i class="xaatl igpdf">PDF</i><b>Flow map</b><small>Systems and triggers</small></p><p><i class="xaatl igxls">XLS</i><b>Field map</b><small>Every mapped field</small></p><p><i class="xaatl igpdf">PDF</i><b>Error codes</b><small>What each one means</small></p></div></div></div><p>A tested, working flow plus a handover pack: the flow map, field mapping and error codes, so your team knows what runs and what to do when something is held. Testing and handover are included in every package.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-who-looks-after-it-after-launch"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Who looks after it after launch?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>System care</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq2"><div class="on"><b>System Care</b><small>1 system · monitoring + fixes · 1.5 h</small><em>RM399</em></div><div><b>System Care Plus</b><small>Up to 3 systems · monthly review · 5 h</small><em>RM999</em></div><div><b>System Priority</b><small>Up to 6 systems · priority queue · 10 h</small><em>RM1,999</em></div></div></div></div><p>System care plans cover integrations after launch. System Care is RM399 a month for 1 system with monitoring, bug fixes and 1.5 support hours. System Care Plus is RM999 for up to 3 systems with a monthly review and 5 hours. System Priority is RM1,999 for up to 6 systems with a priority queue, a report and 10 hours.</p></div></div></article>
